<%- include('partials/header') %>
      <div class="authorization-page-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="authorization-page-kicker">COOKIE CREDENTIALS</p>
          <h1>授权管理</h1>
          <p class="authorization-page-summary">为每个平台保存一份 Netscape 格式的 Cookie 文件。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="authorization-page-error" class="alert alert-danger" role="alert" hidden></div>

      <div class="alert alert-warning authorization-integration-warning" role="alert">
        <strong>尚未接入业务流程</strong>
        <p class="mb-0">已保存的 Cookie 不会用于频道同步、元数据探测或媒体下载，配置成功不会改变这些流程的当前行为。</p>
      </div>

      <% const authorizationPlatforms = [
        { id: 'youtube', label: 'YouTube' },
        { id: 'bilibili', label: 'Bilibili' },
        { id: 'x', label: 'X' },
        { id: 'facebook', label: 'Facebook' },
        { id: 'douyin', label: '抖音' },
      ]; %>
      <section class="authorization-platform-section" aria-labelledby="authorization-platform-title">
        <div class="authorization-section-heading">
          <div>
            <h2 id="authorization-platform-title">平台配置</h2>
            <p>每个平台仅保存一份文件；再次上传会完整替换已有配置。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="authorization-platform-list" class="authorization-platform-grid">
          <% for (const platform of authorizationPlatforms) { %>
            <article class="authorization-platform-card" data-authorization-platform="<%= platform.id %>">
              <div class="authorization-card-heading">
                <h3><%= platform.label %></h3>
                <span class="authorization-status" data-authorization-status hidden></span>
              </div>
              <p class="authorization-updated" data-authorization-updated hidden>
                更新时间：<time data-authorization-time></time>
              </p>
              <form class="authorization-upload-form" data-authorization-upload>
                <label class="form-label" for="authorization-file-<%= platform.id %>">Netscape Cookie 文件</label>
                <input class="form-control" id="authorization-file-<%= platform.id %>" name="cookieFile" type="file" accept=".txt,text/plain" required>
                <div class="authorization-actions">
                  <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" data-authorization-submit>上传</button>
                  <div data-authorization-delete></div>
                </div>
              </form>
              <div class="alert alert-danger authorization-card-error" data-authorization-error role="alert" hidden></div>
            </article>
          <% } %>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="authorization-safety-card" aria-labelledby="authorization-safety-title">
        <h2 id="authorization-safety-title">安全获取与导出说明</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>只在可信设备上登录目标平台，并使用可信工具从当前登录会话导出 Netscape 格式的 <code>cookies.txt</code>。</li>
          <li>在上方对应平台选择导出的文件并上传。系统不会读取浏览器资料目录、代替你登录、转换其他授权格式或验证远端有效性。</li>
          <li>Cookie 等同账号登录凭据。不要通过聊天、工单、截图、日志或公开文件传递原文；不再需要或怀疑泄露时，请删除配置或重新导出后替换。</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="mb-0"><strong>“已配置”仅表示文件已保存且格式正确，不代表登录态当前有效。</strong></p>
      </section>
    </main>
    <script type="module" src="/public/authorizations.js"></script>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
